Package: limpet-tools
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.11), python3-jinja2, git
Description: Limpet plugin registry CLI and reconcile daemon
 `limpet` is the operator/agent front door to the Limpet plugin registry:
 validate a limpet-plugin.toml, list installed plugins and effective state,
 enable/disable a plugin, run health checks, and reconcile the unified
 manifest. `limpet-registry-daemon` wraps the same reconcile loop in a
 periodic timer so a dropped-in plugin is picked up without a restart.
